ntent-2041\\\" class=\\\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"1\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"koje-formate-fajlova-prihvatate\\\"><p>Najbolje je poslati vektorske formate kao \\u0161to su DXF, DWG, AI ili EPS. Ako imate samo skicu ili sliku sa dimenzijama, na\\u0161 tim mo\\u017ee pripremiti CAD model za vas.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div><div class=\\\"eael-accordion-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"koja-je-maksimalna-debljina-seenja-metala\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2042\\\"><span class=\\\"eael-accordion-tab-title\\\">Koja je maksimalna debljina se\\u010denja metala?<\\/span><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 256 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/div><div id=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2042\\\" class=\\\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\\\" data-tab=\\\"2\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"koja-je-maksimalna-debljina-seenja-metala\\\"><p>Na\\u0161 fiber laser kapaciteta 6kW se\\u010de crni \\u010delik do 20mm, ner\\u0111aju\\u0107i \\u010delik (inoks) do 12mm i aluminijum do 10mm debljine.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div><div class=\\\"eael-accordion-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div id=\\\"koliko-se-eka-na-izradu-porudbine\\\" class=\\\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\" data-tab=\\\"3\\\" aria-controls=\\\"elementor-tab-content-2043\\\"><span class=\\\"eael-accordion-tab-title\\\">Koliko se \\u010deka na izradu porud\\u017ebine?<\\/span><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 256 512\\\" xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\"