82l.29-.22V416h192c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V192c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32zm-32 128h-64v-64h64v64zm-352-96c0-35.29 28.71-64 64-64h224V32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H96C78.33 0 64 14.33 64 32v192h96v-32z\"></path></svg>						\n										info@mihalaser.rs\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M444.52 3.52L28.74 195.42c-47.97 22.39-31.98 92.75 19.19 92.75h175.91v175.91c0 51.17 70.36 67.17 92.75 19.19l191.9-415.78c15.99-38.39-25.59-79.97-63.97-63.97z\"></path></svg>						\n										Industrijska zona bb, 11000 Beograd, Srbija\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm61.8-104.4l-84.9-61.7c-3.1-2.3-4.9-5.9-4.9-9.7V116c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h32c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v141.7l66.8 48.6c5.4 3.9 6.5 11.4 2.6 16.8L334.6 349c-3.9 5.3-11.4 6.5-16.8 2.6z\"></path></svg>						\n										Pon - Pet: 08:00 - 17:00 | Sub: 08:00 - 14:00\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n  SAVET\n  <p>\n    Za najbržu i najprecizniju ponudu priložite u poruci dimenzije, debljinu materijala i količinu. Ako imate DXF, DWG ili PDF crtež — pomenite to u poruci i poslaćemo vam email za slanje fajla.\n  </p>\n<style>\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\');\n.tip-box {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 464px;\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 24px 30px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n}\n.tip-title {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.tip-text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n/* Responzivnost za manje uređaje */\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .tip-box {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .tip-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n}\n</style>					\n    FORMA ZA UPIT\n      [text* tvoja-poruka placeholder \"Ime i prezime / naziv firme *\"]\n      [email* tvoj-email placeholder \"Email adresa *\"]\n      [tel* tvoj-telefon placeholder \"Broj telefona *\"]\n      [select tvoja-usluga \"Lasersko sečenje metala\" \"Lasersko graviranje\" \"Industrijsko obeležavanje\" \"CNC Obrada & Savijanje\"]\n    [textarea* detalji-upita rows:5 placeholder \"Detalji upita — materijal, debljina, dimenzije, količina... *\"]\n  [submit class:submit-btn \"POŠALJITE UPIT\"]\n<style>\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap\');\n.inquiry-form {\n  background-color: #111823;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  padding: 40px;\n  max-width: 800px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n.form-tag {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.form-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n.input-group {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.inquiry-form input,\n.inquiry-form select,\n.inquiry-form textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  padding: 16px 20px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  outline: none;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n.inquiry-form input::placeholder,\n.inquiry-form textarea::placeholder {\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n.inquiry-form select {\n  appearance: none;\n  background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\' width=\'16\' height=\'16\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'%2364748b\' stroke-width=\'2\' stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\'><polyline points=\'6 9 12 15 18 9\'></polyline></svg>\");\n  background-repeat: no-repeat;\n  background-position: right 20px center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.inquiry-form select option {\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n.inquiry-form textarea {\n  resize: vertical;\n  min-height: 140px;\n}\n.inquiry-form input:focus,\n.inquiry-form select:focus,\n.inquiry-form textarea:focus {\n  border-color: #00e5ff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);\n}\n.submit-btn {\n  background-color: #00e5ff;\n  color: #0b0f17;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 16px 32px;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n.submit-btn:hover {\n  background-color: #33ebff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .form-row {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .submit-btn {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .inquiry-form {\n    padding: 24px;\n  }\n}\n</style>					<img data-interaction-id=\"23dc2a3f\" id=\"11\" src=\"http://mihamiha.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/mihalogo.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"36\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<p>Mikronska preciznost laserskog sečenja i graviranja.\nFiber i CO2 laserska obrada metala i nemetala.</p>							\n					<a href=\"#\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mihalaser\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n							<h3>Navigacija</h3>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"/pocetna\">\n											Početna\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/o-nama\">\n											O nama\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/usluge\">\n											Usluge\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/galerija\">\n											Galerija\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/kontakt\">\n											Kontakt\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h3>Kontakt</h3>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											+381 64 123 4567\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											info@mihalaser.rs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											Industrijska zona bb,