0 0V1H44V0V-1H0V0ZM44 0H43V44H44H45V0H44ZM44 44V43H0V44V45H44V44ZM0 44H1V0H0H-1V44H0Z\" fill=\"#94A3B8\" mask=\"url(#path-1-inside-1_1_371)\"></path><path d=\"M28.6667 20.3333C28.6667 24.4941 24.0508 28.8275 22.5008 30.1658C22.3564 30.2744 22.1807 30.3331 22 30.3331C21.8193 30.3331 21.6436 30.2744 21.4992 30.1658C19.9492 28.8275 15.3333 24.4941 15.3333 20.3333C15.3333 18.5652 16.0357 16.8695 17.286 15.6192C18.5362 14.369 20.2319 13.6666 22 13.6666C23.7681 13.6666 25.4638 14.369 26.7141 15.6192C27.9643 16.8695 28.6667 18.5652 28.6667 20.3333Z\" stroke-width=\"1.66667\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\"></path><path d=\"M24.5 20.3334C24.5 21.7141 23.3807 22.8334 22 22.8334C20.6193 22.8334 19.5 21.7141 19.5 20.3334C19.5 18.9527 20.6193 17.8334 22 17.8334C23.3807 17.8334 24.5 18.9527 24.5 20.3334Z\" stroke-width=\"1.66667\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\"></path></svg>						\n										Industrijska zona bb, 11000 Beograd, Srbija\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" viewBox=\"0 0 44 44\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"path-1-inside-1_1_378\" fill=\"white\"><path d=\"M0 0H44V44H0V0Z\"></path></mask><path d=\"M0 0V-1H-1V0H0ZM44 0H45V-1H44V0ZM44 44V45H45V44H44ZM0 44H-1V45H0V44ZM0 0V1H44V0V-1H0V0ZM44 0H43V44H44H45V0H44ZM44 44V43H0V44V45H44V44ZM0 44H1V0H0H-1V44H0Z\" fill=\"#94A3B8\" mask=\"url(#path-1-inside-1_1_378)\"></path><path d=\"M30.3333 22C30.3333 26.6023 26.6024 30.3333 22 30.3333C17.3976 30.3333 13.6667 26.6023 13.6667 22C13.6667 17.3976 17.3976 13.6666 22 13.6666C26.6024 13.6666 30.3333 17.3976 30.3333 22Z\" stroke-width=\"1.66667\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\"></path><path d=\"M22 17V22L25.3333 23.6667\" stroke-width=\"1.66667\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\"></path></svg>						\n										Pon - Pet: 08:00 - 17:00 | Sub: 08:00 - 14:00\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n  SAVET\n  <p>\n    Za najbržu i najprecizniju ponudu priložite u poruci dimenzije, debljinu materijala i količinu. Ako imate DXF, DWG ili PDF crtež — pomenite to u poruci i poslaćemo vam email za slanje fajla.\n  </p>\n<style>\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\');\n.tip-box {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 464px;\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 24px 30px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n}\n.tip-title {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.tip-text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n/* Responzivnost za manje uređaje */\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .tip-box {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .tip-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n}\n</style>					\n    FORMA ZA UPIT\n  <form action=\"#\" method=\"POST\">\n        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ime i prezime / naziv firme *\" required>\n        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email adresa *\" required>\n        <input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Broj telefona *\" required>\n        <select required>\n          <option value=\"\" disabled selected hidden>Lasersko sečenje metala</option>\n          <option value=\"lasersko-secenje\">Lasersko sečenje metala</option>\n          <option value=\"lasersko-graviranje\">Lasersko graviranje</option>\n          <option value=\"industrijsko-obelezavanje\">Industrijsko obeležavanje</option>\n          <option value=\"cnc-obrada\">CNC Obrada & Savijanje</option>\n        </select>\n      <textarea rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Detalji upita — materijal, debljina, dimenzije, količina... *\" required></textarea>\n    <button type=\"submit\">\n      POŠALJITE UPIT\n      <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <line x1=\"22\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"11\" y2=\"13\"></line>\n        <polygon points=\"22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2\"></polygon>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </form>\n<style>\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap\');\n.inquiry-form {\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  padding: 30px;\n  max-width: 720px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.form-tag {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n.inquiry-form form {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.form-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.input-group {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.inquiry-form input,\n.inquiry-form select,\n.inquiry-form textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  background-color: #121824;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  outline: none;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  border-radius: 0px;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.inquiry-form input::placeholder,\n.inquiry-form textarea::placeholder {\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n.inquiry-form select {\n  appearance: none;\n  background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\' width=\'16\' height=\'16\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'%2364748b\' stroke-width=\'2\' stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\'><polyline points=\'6 9 12 15 18 9\'></polyline></svg>\");\n  background-repeat: no-repeat;\n  background-position: right 18px center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.inquiry-form select option {\n  background-color: #121824;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n.inquiry-form textarea {\n  resize: vertical;\n  min-height: 120px;\n}\n.inquiry-form input:focus,\n.inquiry-form select:focus,\n.inquiry-form textarea:focus {\n  border-color: #00e5ff;\n}\n.submit-btn {\n  background-color: #00e5ff;\n  color: #0b0f17;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 16px 28px;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n  border-radius: 0px;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n.submit-btn:hover {\n  background-color: #33ebff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .form-row {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .submit-btn {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .inquiry-form {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n}\n</style>					<img data-interaction-id=\"23dc2a3f\" id=\"11\" src=\"http://mihamiha.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/mihalogo.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"36\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<p>Mikronska preciznost laserskog sečenja i graviranja.\nFiber i CO2 laserska obrada metala i nemetala.</p>							\n					<a href=\"#\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mihalaser\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n							<h3>Navigacija</h3>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"/pocetna\">\n											Početna\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/o-nama\">\n											O nama\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/usluge\">\n											Usluge\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/galerija\">\n											Galerija\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/kontakt\">\n											Kontakt\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h3>Kontakt</h3>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											+381 64 123 4567\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											info@mihalaser.rs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											Industrijska zona bb, 11000 Beograd, Srbija\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											Pon - Pet: 08:00 - 17:00 | Sub: 08:00 - 14:00\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<p>© 2026 Miha Laser — Laserske usluge. Sva prava zadržana.</p>','Kontakt','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-11-05 13:53:09','2026-11-05 13:53:09','',24,'http://mihamiha.local/?p=342',0,'revision',''