0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"/></svg>\n      Mesing\n    8 mm\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"/></svg>\n      Bakar\n    6 mm\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"/></svg>\n      Drvo / MDF (graviranje)\n    20 mm\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"/></svg>\n      Pleksiglas / Akril\n    15 mm\n<style>@import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\');\n.materials-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1232px;\n  background-color: #0b0f17;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 10px 32px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: \'Outfit\', sans-serif;\n}\n.material-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 18px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n}\n.material-row:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n.material-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.material-icon {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.material-name {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n.material-value {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #ff3333;\n}\n.unit {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: #ff3333;\n  margin-left: 2px;\n}\n/* Responzivnost za manje ekrane i mobilne */\n@media (max-width: 576px) {\n  .materials-table {\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n  }\n  .material-name {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .material-value {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n}</style>					<p data-interaction-id=\"7ff7a472\">// ČESTA PITANJA</p>\n					<h2 data-interaction-id=\"843f5db\">Odgovori na Najčešća Pitanja</h2>\n					Koje formate fajlova prihvatate?<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg><p>We provide the most user-friendly service for you to develop your software with the best user-experience design. You can come up with an idea, design plan or we are open for discussion to help you to develop your desired software efficiently. </p>\n					Koja je maksimalna debljina sečenja metala?<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg><p>We provide the most user-friendly service for you to develop your software with the best user-experience design. You can come up with an idea, design plan or we are open for discussion to help you to develop your desired software efficiently. </p>\n					Koliko se čeka na izradu porudžbine?<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg><p>We provide the most user-friendly service for you to develop your software with the best user-experience design. You can come up with an idea, design plan or we are open for discussion to help you to develop your desired software efficiently. </p>\n					Da li vršite slanje gotovih komada na adresu?<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg><p>We provide the most user-friendly service for you to develop your software with the best user-experience design. You can come up with an idea, design plan or we are open for discussion to help you to develop your desired software efficiently. </p>\n										<img data-interaction-id=\"7fae6052\" id=\"11\" src=\"http://mihamiha.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/mihalogo.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"36\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<p>Mikronska preciznost laserskog sečenja i graviranja.\nFiber i CO2 laserska obrada metala i nemetala.</p>							\n					<a href=\"#\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mihalaser\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 